        "body": "<p>Welcome to MAISON AMIIR<sup>TM</sup>. By accessing our website or purchasing our products, you agree to the following Terms &amp; Conditions. Please read them carefully before placing an order.</p><p><em>Last Updated: 17 November 2026</em></p><p><strong>1. General Information</strong><br>This website is owned and operated by M/s. Amire Parfum, a sole proprietorship trading under the brand name MAISON AMIIR<sup>TM</sup>, India. Throughout this website, the terms \"we\", \"our\" and \"us\" refer to Amire Parfum and its brand MAISON AMIIR<sup>TM</sup>.</p><p><strong>2. Eligibility</strong><br>Customers must be at least 18 years old to place orders on our website. By purchasing from us, you confirm that the information provided is accurate and complete.</p><p><strong>3. Products &amp; Fragrance Disclaimer</strong><br>All products listed on our website are original creations by MAISON AMIIR, crafted using high-quality perfume oils. Our perfumes and oils are artisanal interpretations inspired by the essence of well-known brands, yet are independent creations. Amire Parfum and MAISON AMIIR are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any of the designers or manufacturers mentioned. Trademarks and copyrights associated with these brands are the sole property of their respective owners. These references are used for comparison purposes only, to help our customers understand the unique character and scent profile of each fragrance.</p><p><strong>4. Pricing &amp; Availability</strong><br>All prices are displayed in the applicable currency for the customer's selected market. Prices, offers and product availability may change without prior notice. Applicable taxes, shipping charges and other fees will be displayed during checkout wherever applicable. We reserve the right to correct pricing errors and cancel orders affected by genuine technical or pricing errors, subject to applicable consumer laws and appropriate refunds.</p><p><strong>5. Order Cancellation &amp; Refunds</strong><br>Customers may request cancellation prior to shipment. If cancelled before dispatch, Amire Parfum will refund the paid amount after deducting payment gateway charges actually levied on the original transaction. Cancellations cannot be accepted once the order has been dispatched. Refunds are processed within 3–7 working days.</p><p><strong>6. Returns, Replacements &amp; Damaged Products</strong><br>Due to the personal-care and hygiene nature of fragrances, returns of opened or used products for change-of-mind reasons are generally not accepted. However, customers may contact us if they receive a damaged product, an incorrect product, a defective product, or a product materially different from its description. Such claims are subject to verification and applicable consumer rights. Customers may be requested to provide photographs or an unboxing video to assist with verification. Approved claims will be resolved through an appropriate replacement, refund or other applicable remedy.</p><p><strong>7. Payment</strong><br>We accept UPI, Debit/Credit Cards, Net Banking, and Wallets. Cash on Delivery (COD) is not available. Standard payment gateway charges may apply.</p><p><strong>8. Promotions, Discounts &amp; Store Credits</strong><br>MAISON AMIIR may offer promotional discounts, welcome credits, loyalty rewards, creator rewards, gift offers and other promotional benefits. Each promotion may have separate eligibility requirements, redemption limits, validity periods and terms. Unless expressly stated otherwise, promotional benefits cannot be combined with other offers or no exchanged for cash will be offered. Store credits are subject to their applicable programme terms, including validity and redemption conditions.</p><p><strong>9. Intellectual Property</strong><br>All original website content, brand assets, logos, product photography, designs, graphics and other proprietary materials belonging to MAISON AMIIR<sup>TM</sup> are protected by